        "en": "**Goal:** Convert simulation-initialized generated videos into executable dexterous robot demonstrations.\n**Method:** Recover and align hand-object motion, retarget it, then refine imperfect references with PPO residual RL, a backward curriculum and physically valid reset states.\n**Output:** Optimized robot trajectories; real-world demonstrations replay them open loop.",
        "zh": "**目标：**将仿真场景初始化的生成视频转为可执行灵巧手示范。\n**方法：**恢复并对齐手物运动，重定向后用 PPO 残差 RL、倒序课程及物理有效重置状态修正不可靠参考。\n**输出：**优化后的机器人轨迹；真机展示采用开环回放。"
