      "tldr": {
        "en": "**Type:** Primarily a VTLA dataset, with a tactile UMI-style collection interface and processing methods.\n**Construction:** Record synchronized vision, touch and end-effector motion without the target robot, with language descriptions; curate trajectories and annotate contact phases, subtasks and target objects.\n**Scale/release:** Paper reports 10,000+ hours, 1M+ episodes and 1,000+ task types. The official portal advertises an initial 1,000-hour subset; replay/kinematic tools are public, while policy training/evaluation code is forthcoming.",
        "zh": "**定位：**以视觉—触觉—语言—动作（VTLA）数据集为主，配套触觉 UMI 采集器与处理方法。\n**构建：**无需目标机器人，采集同步视觉、触觉与末端运动，配语言描述；质控过滤后标注接触阶段、子任务与目标物体。\n**规模／开放：**论文报告 1 万＋小时、100 万＋段、1000＋任务类型；官方门户标注首批 1000 小时子集，重放／运动学工具公开，策略训练与评测代码待发布。"
      },
      "evaluation_scope": {
        "en": "TacClaw is a handheld gripper interface, not an articulated multi-finger hand. Two policies, π0.5 and StarVLA, are tested on three bimanual tasks across Tianji Marvin M6S Lite, RealMan RM75-b and DM-Sparky One, using 1,600 demonstrations and 50 trials per task. Collection scale is not the number of deployed evaluation tasks.",
        "zh": "TacClaw 为手持夹持采集器，不是多指关节手。π0.5、StarVLA 在 Tianji Marvin M6S Lite、RealMan RM75-b、DM-Sparky One 上验证叠杯、瓶子分类、擦花瓶三个双臂任务，每任务 1600 条训练示范、50 次评测；采集任务规模不等于部署评测任务数。"
      },
